# Protect Line north star

You are working on the Protect Line design system. Use British English.

- Canonical visual truth: `DESIGN.md` + `colors_and_type.css`
- Do not invent brand colours, fonts, logos, or customer facts
- Mark gaps with `[REQUIRES SOURCE]`
- Name is two words: **Protect Line** (never "Protectline")
- Sentence case everywhere; British spelling
- Poppins primary, Lora Bold-Italic accent only, Arial email fallback only
- Hot pink (`--color-hot-pink`) used sparingly for CTAs, links, Hugo
- No generic SaaS styling (Inter, sky blue, card shadows)
- For any visual task, read `DESIGN.md` before generating UI
